# Cloudflare Pages response headers (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# Source of truth: deployment/cloudflare/_headers — the build copies this
# file verbatim to docs/_headers. GitHub Pages ignores it; it only takes
# effect if the site is ever deployed on Cloudflare Pages (which is
# prepared but NOT active — see docs-for-maintainers/cloudflare-pages.md).
#
# Deliberately conservative starting policy:
# - No Content-Security-Policy yet: the pages carry an inline pre-paint
#   theme script, and a CSP must be designed and tested against that
#   script, the local assets, external ETSI links, print and every
#   Playwright suite before it ships. 'unsafe-inline' merely to make a
#   CSP pass would weaken it to the point of theatre, so no CSP at all
#   until hashes/nonces are properly introduced and tested.
#
# Caching: the build now content-fingerprints the CSS and JS filenames
# (e.g. assets/js/main.<hash>.js). A fingerprinted URL only ever serves
# one exact set of bytes — when the file changes, its name changes and
# every referencing page is regenerated in the same build — so those
# files are safe to cache for a year as immutable. HTML is NOT
# fingerprinted (page URLs are stable, reader-facing links), so it must
# stay revalidating; likewise the search indexes and images keep short,
# revalidating caches so a content change is picked up promptly. GitHub
# Pages ignores this file entirely and applies its own ~10-minute cache;
# these rules only take effect on Cloudflare Pages.

# Fingerprinted, immutable assets (name changes when content changes).
/assets/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Unfingerprinted resources: cache briefly but always revalidate.
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/search-index.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/search-suggestions.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/assets/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
